<title>BELGIUM: Belgian federal spending flat in H1 1997.</title>
<headline>Belgian federal spending flat in H1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credits taken up for primary spending by the Belgian federal government were 610.7 billion Belgian francs in the first six months of 1997, little changed from 609.9 billion francs in the year-ago period, the Budget Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>Adjusted to take account of inflation, federal spending fell by 1.4 percent, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
